F-111E Aardvark  Armament: Internal bomb bay for 2 2,000 lb bombs or fuel tanks, or 20 mm M61A-1 cannon. 8 underwing pylons for 14,290 Kg (31,500 lb) of ordnance and drop tanks. Could carry 24 500 lb bombs on wings! Other: the EF-111A Raven performs electronic warfare roles, jammers mostly, no ammo.